  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trapca - ESAMI</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Trapca - ESAMI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xF6;r att &#xF6;ka kapciteten inom det handelspolitiska omr&#xE5;det i MUL- l&#xE4;nderna har Sida givit st&#xF6;d till uppr&#xE4;ttandet av Trade Policy Training Centre in Africa - trapca. Institutet riktar sig fr&#xE4;mst till statliga tj&#xE4;nstem&#xE4;n och ger utbildning i handelspolitik genom korta kurser och p&#xE5; Mastersniv&#xE5;.ESAMI &#xE4;r v&#xE4;rdorganisation och Sidas kontraktspartner. Lunds Universitet ansvarar f&#xF6;r examination.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inorder to enhance capacity in the area of trade policy in the LDC countreis, Sida has supported the establishment of Trade Policy Training Centre in Africa - trapca. The institution targets mainly government officials and provides training in trade policy thorugh short courses and at Masters Level. ESAMI is host organisation and Sidas aggreement partner. Lund Univ. is responsible for examination.</narrative>
  </description>
